        ("Can you change the 'this' binding of an arrow function using call(), apply(), or bind()?", "No. The 'this' of an arrow function is permanently locked to its lexical scope and cannot be overridden by call, apply, or bind.", "Intermediate", "Concept", "", "What happens if you pass a context to arrowFn.call(obj)?"),
